### 10. ⚠️ LOW: Missing HTTPS/TLS Configuration
**Severity:** LOW (in development) / CRITICAL (in production)  
**Category:** A02:2021 – Cryptographic Failures

**Issue:**
No HTTPS enforced. Data transmitted in plaintext.

**Risk:**
- Data interception
- Man-in-the-middle attacks
- Credential theft

**Remediation:**
```javascript
const https = require('https');
const fs = require('fs');

if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production') {
  // ✅ Use HTTPS in production
  const options = {
    key: fs.readFileSync(process.env.SSL_KEY_PATH),
    cert: fs.readFileSync(process.env.SSL_CERT_PATH),
  };

  https.createServer(options, app).listen(443, () => {
    console.log('Secure server running on port 443');
  });
} else {
  // Development only
  app.listen(3000, () => {
    console.log('Server running on port 3000 (INSECURE - development only)');
  });
}
```

